UnitDynamicSwapFeeHook::SetCustomBaseFee
├── when caller is not Fee Manager
│   └── it should revert with "NFM"
└── when caller is Fee Manager
    ├── when custom fee is gt max base fee and not zero fee indicator
    │   └── it should revert with "MBF"
    ├── when pool is invalid
    │   └── it should revert with "PNP"
    └── when pool is valid
        ├── when custom fee is zero fee indicator
        │   ├── it should set custom fee to zero fee indicator
        │   └── it should emit CustomFeeSet
        └── when custom fee is not zero fee indicator
            ├── it should set custom fee
            └── it should emit CustomFeeSet
